---
// Design: Floor variant a. Perspective checkerboard.
---
<div class="floor" aria-hidden="true"><div class="tiles"></div></div>

<style>
  .floor {
    position: relative;
    height: clamp(120px, 16vw, 200px);
    overflow: hidden;
    border-top: 4px solid var(--ink);
    perspective: 360px;
    perspective-origin: 50% 0%;
    background: var(--floor-a);
  }
  .tiles {
    position: absolute;
    left: -80%;
    right: -80%;
    bottom: 0;
    height: 900px;
    transform-origin: 50% 100%;
    transform: rotateX(62deg);
    background: repeating-conic-gradient(var(--floor-a) 0 25%, var(--floor-b) 0 50%) 0 0 / 90px 90px;
  }
</style>
